commit e0d56c79d4f55e278c36cdcc76b76b66fe2509fd
Author: Archi <dev@example.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 17 22:14:35 2026 +0200

    fix(runner): filter pipelines and command lists in the Token saver hook
    
    parseHookCommand now takes a line apart into pipelines of simple commands
    joined by &&, || and ;, each command optionally ending in 2>&1. The hook wraps
    the first command of every pipeline a filter covers and keeps the rest of the
    pipe and every uncovered command as written. Deny/ask rules are matched on
    every command of the line. The filter goes quiet and sends its child SIGPIPE
    when a later stage (| head) closes the pipe early.
    
    Refs #610

