commit 66f08fe6ce3f91216661a4a3c3759b8ba85b5e4d
Author: Archi <dev@example.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 17 21:44:43 2026 +0200

    fix(design): the generate panel reads the profile's status; a busy design with nothing running shows as starting
    
    The panel said a project had no UI profile whenever the design had no
    revision yet, because it read the design's profileId. It now reads the
    project's profile status: missing, failed rebuild, or building.
    
    A design busy between two turns (or whose next turn never started) showed
    the Generate panel with no progress and no Stop. It now shows a starting
    state with Stop.

commit 42c71cb55fbf582a831cfe02dd5dd38eac888970
Author: Archi <dev@example.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 17 21:43:00 2026 +0200

    fix(design): claim the busy status before the profile check; Stop settles a design left busy with nothing running
    
    Two Generates at once both passed the idle check; the loser's failed turn
    start then settled the design while the winner's turn ran. The busy status
    is now claimed atomically from the status read at rest.
    
    A design left generating or revising with no turn and no build (a batch
    whose next turn never started) refused Generate as busy and Stop as not
    running. Stop now puts it back to rest.

